// ── Section 8 Renewal Academy — full course ──────────────────────────────────
// Renewal of expiring project-based Section 8 HAP contracts under MAHRA: the
// six owner options, contract terms, early termination, rent comparability
// studies, OCAF and budget-based rent adjustments, opt-outs and tenant
// protection. Same data shape as the NSPIRE / MOR / Occupancy academies:
// RENEWAL_UNITS, RENEWAL_CHAPTERS, RENEWAL_CHAPTER_QUIZZES, RENEWAL_UNIT_TESTS.
//
// Source: HUD Office of Multifamily Housing, Section 8 Renewal Policy Guidebook,
// published March 27, 2023, effective for renewal and amend-rent packages
// received (or postmarked) on or after May 1, 2023. Every rule and figure is
// stated as it appears in the Guide and cited by its section number
// ("Section 2-17.B"). Where the Guide is internally inconsistent or has been
// overtaken by later federal practice, that is flagged inline as a "Source
// note" rather than silently corrected, so what a reviewer will test against
// the Guide stays intact.
//
// Worked examples use invented projects and figures applied to the Guide's
// rules; the quiz questions deliberately use different numbers from the
// lessons so they test the rule, not recall of a worked answer.

